1
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:18,260
♪If I am gone from this world,
will the dark night collapse?♪

2
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:25,820
♪If I never return
to guard by your side♪

3
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:30,800
♪If I seal away our encounter
and erase all trace♪

4
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:33,900
♪Like endless snow
falling into the deep sea♪

5
00:00:34,050 --> 00:00:40,350
♪This life is but a fleeting illusion,
yet it gave me courage♪

6
00:00:40,510 --> 00:00:41,740
♪Love is a miracle♪

7
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:42,920
=Spring Over Phoenix Pond=

8
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:45,300
(Adapted from Qin An'an's
"Spring Over Phoenix Pond")

9
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:48,260
=Episode 5=

10
00:01:08,350 --> 00:01:09,760
(He was actually serious.)

11
00:01:17,710 --> 00:01:18,790
Young Lady Qi,

12
00:01:19,590 --> 00:01:21,150
do you resist me that much?

13
00:01:41,760 --> 00:01:43,070
I will not help you.

14
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:47,200
I hope Your Highness

15
00:01:47,510 --> 00:01:48,560
does not regret this.

16
00:02:03,310 --> 00:02:04,590
Your subordinate failed.

17
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:06,280
Someone got to the account book first

18
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:07,040
and took it.

19
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:08,190
Who?

20
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:14,750
Qi Yuan.

21
00:02:16,080 --> 00:02:17,590
How did she know
we were checking the account book?

22
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:19,150
Where is she?

23
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:20,280
Early this morning,

24
00:02:20,590 --> 00:02:22,470
the Qi family
set off for Guanyin Temple.

25
00:02:23,310 --> 00:02:23,800
Prepare a horse.

26
00:02:25,080 --> 00:02:26,120
To Guanyin Temple.

27
00:02:26,240 --> 00:02:28,150
(She actually used
the account book to force my hand.)

28
00:02:28,430 --> 00:02:28,910
Ling.

29
00:02:29,310 --> 00:02:29,800
I'm here.

30
00:02:31,470 --> 00:02:32,870
Look, this is written so well.

31
00:02:33,710 --> 00:02:35,890
- This view beats the manor's.
- This one is great.

32
00:02:35,890 --> 00:02:36,730
This one's nice, too.

33
00:02:36,730 --> 00:02:37,370
Yes, indeed.

34
00:02:37,510 --> 00:02:38,310
You can write one too.

35
00:02:39,560 --> 00:02:40,630
Judging by the time,

36
00:02:41,080 --> 00:02:42,470
Prince Jing should be arriving soon.

37
00:02:44,470 --> 00:02:45,150
Lianqiao,

38
00:02:45,470 --> 00:02:46,430
go to the entrance to greet him.

39
00:02:46,630 --> 00:02:47,750
Yes, Young Lady.

40
00:02:54,780 --> 00:02:56,060
(Blessed with Sons)

41
00:02:56,060 --> 00:02:58,940
(Miaoyin Pavilion)

42
00:03:05,520 --> 00:03:08,310
I didn't expect
Your Highness to arrive so soon.

43
00:03:10,030 --> 00:03:10,560
You jerk!

44
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:12,080
Why did you force Jin away?

45
00:03:12,150 --> 00:03:13,430
Believe it or not, I'll kill you!

46
00:03:19,710 --> 00:03:21,280
Do you think just because Father
holds a welcome ceremony for you,

47
00:03:21,470 --> 00:03:22,910
you become
the daughter of the Qi family?

48
00:03:23,150 --> 00:03:24,030
Let me tell you,

49
00:03:24,360 --> 00:03:26,190
I am the only son of the Qi family.

50
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:27,750
I am the next Marquis Yongping.

51
00:03:29,870 --> 00:03:30,910
As long as I'm around,

52
00:03:31,080 --> 00:03:32,750
don't ever dream of joining
the family ancestral record.

53
00:03:34,150 --> 00:03:35,280
Once I inherit the title,

54
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:37,360
I'll sell you to a brothel

55
00:03:37,590 --> 00:03:39,190
and let you suffer endless torment.

56
00:03:45,280 --> 00:03:47,430
I'll make you regret what you did today.

57
00:03:48,750 --> 00:03:50,840
Why don't I just kill you right now

58
00:03:51,150 --> 00:03:52,430
to eliminate
the threat once and for all?

59
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:37,310
Let go.

60
00:04:41,430 --> 00:04:42,630
There are people all over outside now.

61
00:04:43,920 --> 00:04:45,310
Are you really going
to commit murder here?

62
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:55,310
Are you alright?

63
00:04:59,750 --> 00:05:00,360
I'm fine.

64
00:05:04,510 --> 00:05:05,070
I know

65
00:05:05,310 --> 00:05:06,430
the account book is with you.

66
00:05:07,190 --> 00:05:08,870
However, that account book
is of great consequence.

67
00:05:09,270 --> 00:05:10,480
I advise you to hand it over.

68
00:05:10,480 --> 00:05:11,120
Indeed.

69
00:05:12,870 --> 00:05:14,630
I know this account book is connected
to the relief fund corruption case

70
00:05:14,630 --> 00:05:16,430
Your Highness is investigating.

71
00:05:16,680 --> 00:05:18,190
Now that
the account book is in my hands,

72
00:05:18,510 --> 00:05:20,870
I hope Your Highness
can invite the Eldest Princess for me.

73
00:05:21,630 --> 00:05:22,950
Are you threatening me?

74
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:24,920
This is a negotiation.

75
00:05:25,270 --> 00:05:26,680
If the Eldest Princess doesn't come,

76
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:28,390
at worst, I'll just return
to the estate.

77
00:05:28,750 --> 00:05:30,120
After all, no matter
how terrible a life it is,

78
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:31,190
I've already lived through it.

79
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:32,750
I'm not afraid of losing it.

80
00:05:33,870 --> 00:05:35,000
But what about Your Highness?

81
00:05:35,800 --> 00:05:38,070
This is powerful evidence
to bring down Prince Qi.

82
00:05:38,950 --> 00:05:40,270
Can you bear to give it up?

83
00:05:48,630 --> 00:05:51,190
Mother told me to go to the main hall
at the hour of the Mao to burn incense.

84
00:05:52,240 --> 00:05:53,120
I'll take my leave now.

85
00:05:54,430 --> 00:05:54,950
Hold on.

86
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:02,750
I can agree to help you,

87
00:06:03,750 --> 00:06:05,310
but you must give me
the account book first.

88
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:09,870
Once the welcome ceremony is over,

89
00:06:10,310 --> 00:06:11,480
I will present it to you.

90
00:06:16,190 --> 00:06:17,560
Look over there. It's so beautiful.

91
00:06:17,950 --> 00:06:18,800
They bloomed so wonderfully.

92
00:06:19,070 --> 00:06:19,750
Yes.

93
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:21,510
How lovely.

94
00:06:23,720 --> 00:06:24,430
Sisters,

95
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:27,480
I heard that for this blessing assembly,

96
00:06:27,480 --> 00:06:29,920
all the noble ladies
of the royal family will attend.

97
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:34,160
Yet Prince Jing
is the only royal prince present.

98
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:36,600
Prince Cheng is a bit strange,

99
00:06:38,510 --> 00:06:39,750
so no one dares to ask him to come.

100
00:06:40,070 --> 00:06:40,510
Right.

101
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:43,190
Prince Qi, on the other hand,
is gentle and refined,

102
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:45,680
but he seems to have fallen ill recently

103
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:46,800
and has been in a coma all this time.

104
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:48,000
In a coma?

105
00:06:48,830 --> 00:06:52,070
(In my past life, Prince Qi was never
said to have a strange illness.)

106
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:55,310
Xiang Rong, come.

107
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:04,830
(Xiang Rong...)

108
00:07:04,830 --> 00:07:05,920
(Xiang Rong, Miss Xiang)

109
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:06,720
(In my past life,)

110
00:07:07,600 --> 00:07:09,360
(she was the only friend
who disregarded my background)

111
00:07:09,950 --> 00:07:11,430
(and was willing to help me.)

112
00:07:14,390 --> 00:07:15,480
Rest assured,

113
00:07:16,870 --> 00:07:18,430
I will cure your leg.

114
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:20,510
Xiang Rong, you're here.

115
00:07:20,830 --> 00:07:21,870
Let me introduce you.

116
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:23,480
This is Young Lady Qi,

117
00:07:23,510 --> 00:07:24,480
Qi Zhao's sister.

118
00:07:24,870 --> 00:07:26,430
Aren't you engaged to Qi Zhao?

119
00:07:26,430 --> 00:07:27,430
Don't mention that engagement.

120
00:07:29,750 --> 00:07:30,630
I have other matters to attend to.

121
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:32,240
I'll take my leave first.

122
00:07:38,340 --> 00:07:41,420
(Just and Honorable, Grand Main Hall)

123
00:07:54,680 --> 00:07:55,390
Madam,

124
00:07:55,750 --> 00:07:57,040
I've had someone examine

125
00:07:57,040 --> 00:07:58,390
their birth charts.

126
00:07:58,510 --> 00:08:01,160
Zhao and Rong are
a match made in heaven.

127
00:08:01,630 --> 00:08:03,750
(Madam Xiang, Xiang Rong's Grandmother)
Marquise Yongping, you acted fast,

128
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:05,430
even matching
their birth charts already.

129
00:08:05,950 --> 00:08:07,040
Of course.

130
00:08:07,240 --> 00:08:08,430
We are all hoping

131
00:08:08,430 --> 00:08:09,950
that Rong marries into our family soon.

132
00:08:14,830 --> 00:08:15,310
Madam.

133
00:08:16,430 --> 00:08:17,120
Zhao.

134
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:18,120
Zhao.

135
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:19,510
Madam.

136
00:08:20,160 --> 00:08:20,480
Madam.

137
00:08:22,950 --> 00:08:23,600
Young Lady,

138
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:24,680
since we are already here,

139
00:08:24,680 --> 00:08:25,830
let's draw a fortune stick as well.

140
00:08:25,870 --> 00:08:26,600
Come on.

141
00:08:28,270 --> 00:08:29,560
Since I have entered the Qi Residence,

142
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:31,160
that in itself is the best fortune.

143
00:08:31,510 --> 00:08:32,080
Let's go.

144
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:33,120
Young Lady,

145
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:34,150
come on.

146
00:08:34,270 --> 00:08:35,240
Draw one.

147
00:08:35,480 --> 00:08:35,870
Hurry.

148
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:51,630
Alright.

149
00:08:53,670 --> 00:08:54,600
You aren't going
to interpret the fortune?

150
00:08:57,030 --> 00:08:58,960
Since Your Highness
wants it interpreted so much,

151
00:08:59,390 --> 00:09:00,360
you can play with it yourself.

152
00:09:12,300 --> 00:09:13,100
(Worst Luck)

153
00:09:17,460 --> 00:09:18,820
(Worst Luck)

154
00:09:20,910 --> 00:09:22,910
Say not that the east wind is useless,

155
00:09:23,750 --> 00:09:27,080
for a single spark of fire
glows from the east on its own.

156
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:32,320
(This fortune text
is exactly the same as before.)

157
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:34,000
At the end of one's rope,

158
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:37,720
walking on thin ice.

159
00:09:44,960 --> 00:09:46,480
If this is the will of Heaven,

160
00:09:53,150 --> 00:09:54,550
how can a single spark of fire

161
00:09:59,480 --> 00:10:01,790
stand against
a sky full of wind and snow?

162
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:06,150
Interesting.

163
00:10:06,870 --> 00:10:10,080
A few days ago, my father mentioned
that joy comes after extreme sorrow.

164
00:10:10,510 --> 00:10:12,270
Though this seems
like the worst fortune,

165
00:10:12,630 --> 00:10:13,910
it conceals a favorable turn.

166
00:10:14,910 --> 00:10:15,870
This is clearly

167
00:10:17,030 --> 00:10:18,320
a sign of great auspiciousness.

168
00:10:20,750 --> 00:10:22,270
(When we met in my past life,)

169
00:10:22,720 --> 00:10:24,080
(the Crown Prince
had already passed away.)

170
00:10:25,080 --> 00:10:26,600
(He was always deeply gloomy.)

171
00:10:28,080 --> 00:10:29,440
(Now that the Crown Prince
is still alive,)

172
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:32,150
(he indeed seems a bit different.)

173
00:10:38,870 --> 00:10:40,080
One does not lie before the Buddha.

174
00:10:41,910 --> 00:10:42,510
Qi Yuan,

175
00:10:42,790 --> 00:10:44,510
what is your background?

176
00:10:47,200 --> 00:10:49,630
Your martial skills aren't those
of an ordinary peasant woman,

177
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:51,630
and you know
I'm investigating the account book

178
00:10:52,270 --> 00:10:53,440
as well as the corruption.

179
00:10:54,120 --> 00:10:55,510
Before you came to the Qi family,

180
00:10:55,750 --> 00:10:57,360
did you never leave the village?

181
00:11:00,270 --> 00:11:01,150
You investigated me?

182
00:11:04,960 --> 00:11:06,240
Rest assured, Your Highness,

183
00:11:06,670 --> 00:11:08,390
I will never become your enemy.

184
00:11:09,390 --> 00:11:10,960
As a gift of gratitude for inviting

185
00:11:10,960 --> 00:11:12,150
the Eldest Princess on my behalf,

186
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:13,390
here is a friendly warning.

187
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:15,600
Pay attention to
the Crown Prince's medicinal decoction.

188
00:11:23,440 --> 00:11:24,630
Go and check my father's diet

189
00:11:24,630 --> 00:11:25,440
to see if there's anything abnormal.

190
00:11:25,440 --> 00:11:26,360
Investigate in secret.

191
00:11:26,510 --> 00:11:27,630
Do not alert the enemy.

192
00:11:28,790 --> 00:11:29,270
Yes.

193
00:11:44,640 --> 00:11:49,280
♪How I wish to hold
onto this fleeting warmth♪

194
00:11:49,660 --> 00:11:53,440
♪How I wish to live
this life only for you♪

195
00:11:53,950 --> 00:11:59,410
♪When memories sink
and the heart settles♪

196
00:11:59,630 --> 00:12:03,790
♪Forgetting life, death,
parting, and reunion♪

197
00:12:04,580 --> 00:12:08,860
♪How I wish to stay
only in the moment with you♪

198
00:12:09,660 --> 00:12:16,560
♪Anchoring myself by your side♪
